config BR2_PACKAGE_RKBUILD_DOCKER_HELPER
	bool "rkbuild-docker-helper"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_DOCKER_ENGINE
	help
	  Docker 相关辅助脚本：
	    - /usr/local/bin/rkbuild-docker-info
	    - /usr/local/bin/rkbuild-docker-preload
	    - /etc/init.d/S96docker-preload
	    - /usr/share/rkbuild/docker-images/ 预置镜像目录占位
	  默认开启。